• Text & Character Analysis (chars(), replaceAll(), LinkedHashMap)
Converts strings to character streams, applies regex filtering, and uses a LinkedHashMap to maintain character frequency ordering.

• Sliding Window Implementation (IntStream.range(), List.subList())
Combines range-based integer streams with sub-lists to process continuous \(N\)-element chunks dynamically.

• Advanced Aggregations (Max metrics, \(N\)-grams)
Computes complex metrics like highest transaction spends, maximum word frequencies, and dynamic sequence extractions (bigrams).

• Custom Classification Rules (Collectors.groupingBy())
Employs static helper methods within collectors to categorize data by non-field dynamic criteria like salary brackets.